WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.621 --> 00:00:01.744
(gentle music)

00:00:01.744 --> 00:00:04.554
- [Narrator] Just a few
weeks ago on September 22nd

00:00:04.554 --> 00:00:06.947
a group of Egyptians
raised the rainbow flag

00:00:06.947 --> 00:00:09.463
at Mashrou' Leila concert.

00:00:09.463 --> 00:00:11.869
This led to the widest
crackdown and arrests

00:00:11.869 --> 00:00:14.286
of LGBT individuals in Egypt.

00:00:17.924 --> 00:00:19.866
Regarding human rights violations

00:00:19.866 --> 00:00:22.614
the victims have been
dealing with physical abuse,

00:00:22.614 --> 00:00:25.183
beatings, groping, cursing.

00:00:25.183 --> 00:00:27.858
They've also had limitations
put on their family

00:00:27.858 --> 00:00:29.283
and legal visitations.

00:00:29.283 --> 00:00:32.188
They've also had anal examinations.

00:00:32.188 --> 00:00:34.262
This treatment is tantamount to torture.

00:00:34.262 --> 00:00:36.574
Now, according to the UN, any arrests

00:00:36.574 --> 00:00:39.993
based on gender identity
or sexual orientation

00:00:39.993 --> 00:00:42.371
are by definition arbitrary, and therefore

00:00:42.371 --> 00:00:44.487
violate International law.

00:00:44.487 --> 00:00:47.070
(gentle music)

00:00:48.927 --> 00:00:51.090
The Egyptian media has
an immediate response

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:52.381
after every crackdown

00:00:52.381 --> 00:00:55.721
by making the queer identity
synonymous with terrorism,

00:00:55.721 --> 00:00:58.291
debauchery and prostitution.

00:00:58.291 --> 00:01:01.208
(foreign language)

00:01:12.663 --> 00:01:14.551
People have been using scare tactics

00:01:14.551 --> 00:01:16.728
and propaganda since
the beginning of time.

00:01:16.728 --> 00:01:19.891
It's our responsibility to
look past these scare tactics

00:01:19.891 --> 00:01:21.752
and see humanity instead.

00:01:21.752 --> 00:01:24.621
On a bright note, eyes
are on Egypt right now

00:01:24.621 --> 00:01:26.591
showing solidarity and support.

00:01:26.591 --> 00:01:29.118
And protests are occurring
all over the world.

00:01:29.118 --> 00:01:31.630
You have queer people, queer Egyptians

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:34.505
who may have located to other
countries outside of their own

00:01:34.505 --> 00:01:36.600
and they're getting attention.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:39.598
And they're getting support
and love and solidarity.

00:01:39.598 --> 00:01:42.094
And they may have been
existing this entire time

00:01:42.094 --> 00:01:44.206
with that same fear instilled in them.

00:01:44.206 --> 00:01:46.819
There are queer Egyptians
around the world right now

00:01:46.819 --> 00:01:48.667
looking over and feeling visible

00:01:48.667 --> 00:01:50.826
and feeling seen and heard and love.

00:01:50.826 --> 00:01:54.870
To my siblings suffering in
prison, you're not alone.

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:58.554
To my queer family around
the globe, you're not alone.

00:01:58.554 --> 00:02:01.333
Your suffering is not gonna go unheard.

00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:03.630
We are working really hard to make sure

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:06.600
that these human rights
violations don't occur again.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:08.631
And to those already in prison for this

00:02:08.631 --> 00:02:09.951
we're working hard to get you out.

00:02:09.951 --> 00:02:12.810
Look for links below to
show support and solidarity.

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:14.963
There are so many
organizations and initiatives

00:02:14.963 --> 00:02:16.257
beginning and springing up.

00:02:16.257 --> 00:02:17.634
And if you want to start your own,

00:02:17.634 --> 00:02:19.046
that would be amazing too.

00:02:19.046 --> 00:02:20.873
(foreign language)

00:02:20.873 --> 00:02:22.670
- Bring hope back to Egypt.

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:23.848
- Bring pride back to Egypt.

00:02:23.848 --> 00:02:25.471
- Bring love back to Egypt.

00:02:25.471 --> 00:02:28.313
- I'm a naval veteran and
I stand with queer Egypt.

00:02:28.313 --> 00:02:30.157
- I stand with queer Egypt.

00:02:30.157 --> 00:02:31.744
(foreign language)

00:02:31.744 --> 00:02:33.278
- Bring pride back to Egypt.

00:02:33.278 --> 00:02:34.313
- I'm with queer Egypt.

00:02:34.313 --> 00:02:35.924
I love you guys, I stand with you guys.

00:02:35.924 --> 00:02:40.091
We're here, we're thinking
of you and we love you.

